            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nUnfortunately, I can not reproduce. Transparency with provided setup for me works both in plain terminal emulator and `tmux`. There is zero configuration for `tmux` in my case, so that might help here.\n\nThere is a *very* low chance that the issue is in MiniMax per se. And with a lack of `tmux` knowledge, I have almost zero clues as to what the issue might be. Did you try the general search for similar issues? neovim/neovim#7764 seems like a good (albeit old) start.\n\nWhat can help debug this further, is:\n- What terminal emulator do you use?\n- What is the value of `$TERM` variable both in plain terminal and `tmux`?",
