        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> What terminal emulator do you use?\n> What is the value of $TERM variable both in plain terminal and tmux?\n\nSorry, yeah I used Ghostty, with $TERM is set to `xterm-ghostty` and `tmux-256color` respectively. The same issue also happened on Wezterm too.\n\n> Do you have transparent background set in terminal emulator and tmux also?\n\nYes, but only in Ghostty. I don't have to do anything special in `tmux`.\n\n```\nbackground-opacity = 0.7\nbackground-blur = true\n```",
